{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-primitive-recursive","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","aliases":["57-df-primitive-recursive","57-df-PR"],"depends_on":["[[57-df-function-closure]]","[[57-df-zero-function]]","[[57-df-successor-function]]","[[57-df-projection-function]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-primrec-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-primitive-recursive</span><span>57-df-PR</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6965d045e3a44cd2\" href=\"?note=6965d045e3a44cd2\" title=\"57-df-function-closure\">57-df-function-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"021aaad5524b9d03\" href=\"?note=021aaad5524b9d03\" title=\"57-df-zero-function\">57-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2a81ec25c112645\" href=\"?note=b2a81ec25c112645\" title=\"57-df-successor-function\">57-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$\">df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,S,\\pi_i^n\">\\(Z,S,\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"021aaad5524b9d03\" href=\"?note=021aaad5524b9d03\" title=\"57-df-zero-function\">57-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2a81ec25c112645\" href=\"?note=b2a81ec25c112645\" title=\"57-df-successor-function\">57-df-successor-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 仍为一元零函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(D_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal F_n\">\\(F=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 作为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6965d045e3a44cd2\" href=\"?note=6965d045e3a44cd2\" title=\"57-df-function-closure\">57-df-function-closure</a> 的闭包论域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h,f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\in F\">\\(g,h,f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\in F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_m:F^{m+1}\\to F\">\\(C_m:F^{m+1}\\to F\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:F^2\\to F\">\\(R:F^2\\to F\\)</span> 在下式定义；类型不相容时返回同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_m(g,f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Comp}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)&amp;g\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(f_i\\in\\mathcal F_n),\\\\\nZ&amp;\\neg(g\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(f_i\\in\\mathcal F_n)).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_m(g,f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Comp}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)&amp;g\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(f_i\\in\\mathcal F_n),\\\\\nZ&amp;\\neg(g\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(f_i\\in\\mathcal F_n)).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R(g,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)&amp;\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}),\\\\\nZ&amp;\\neg\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R(g,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)&amp;\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}),\\\\\nZ&amp;\\neg\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\qquad\nf\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\qquad\nf\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathcal F_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PR}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathcal F_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原来仅在缺失外册中给名的全算子族；正元基底、二参数 Closure 调用和 PR 函数类不变。原 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a> 的结构生成闭包没有被替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$","text":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","level":1},{"