s n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(f_i\\in\\mathcal F_n)).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"R(g,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)&\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}),\\\\\nZ&\\neg\\exists n\\ge1\\;(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\qquad\nf\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathcal F_n\\quad(n\\ge1).","display":true}],"bytes":2105,"backlinks":[{"id":"7419fb5f5a6ad5df","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。自然数加法使用 [[57-df-natural-number]] 的背景算术。"},{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"712165bc47a6ac48","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\dotminus$ 是下式定义的截断减法。"},{"id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$ 为有限自然数列集；列按 $0,\\ldots,\\ell-1$ 编号，空列为 $\\varepsilon$。$\\frown$ 为有限列连接；$\\langle a\\rangle^k$ 为长度 $k$ 且各分量等于 $a$ 的列。$D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；$d\\mid u$ 表示 $\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)$。$\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 的递归调用严格减小自然数参数。"},{"id":"c39eb67536237339","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{mul}$ 取 [[57-df-multiplication-function]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_1$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的签名；$\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-term]]。假定表达式集至多可数。$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 是待选的单射编码，$\\mathrm{GN}_{57}(g,L)$ 为本文件的编码条件。$\\mathrm{PR}$ 仍为 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]] 的数值函数类；$\\chi_E$ 是自然数集合 $E$ 的总特征函数。"},{"id":"c6df01b45cb8cc59","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add}$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\mathrm{PComp